## Troubleshooting and next steps


No message is submitted: check opted_in, verified and existing record state. Preview intentionally permits unverified fixture members. Wrong activity: inspect the UTC range and account mapping; do not remove tenant predicates. Another sender is running: let it finish or confirm its session ended; do not switch lock keys. Idempotency conflict: preserve the original payload and investigate changes. Retry cutoff reached: reconcile with Resend before deciding what happened. Database connection fails: follow your host’s TLS/network instructions rather than disabling certificate checks.


